,2,19)\">Hag 2:19</ref> <highlight>olive trees</highlight>, <bdbheb>עֵץ שֶׁמֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 8:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,15)\">Neh 8:15</ref>, <bdbheb>עֵץשָֿׁ֑מֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,19)\">Isa 41:19</ref> <bdbheb>סֲבָחעֵֿץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,5)\">Ps 74:5</ref> <highlight>thicket of trees</highlight>; <bdbheb>עֵץ הַשָּׂרֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 9:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,25)\">Exod 9:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), +; <bdbheb>עֵץ הַיַּעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 15:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,15,6)\">Ezek 15:6</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 10:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,19)\">Isa 10:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,23)\">Isa 44:23</ref> <bdbheb>כִּימֵי הָעֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,22)\">Isa 65:22</ref> (simile of great age). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> plural of <highlight>trees</highlight> felled for building, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,20)\">1Kgs 5:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,32)\">1Kgs 5:32</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֲבָנִים</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>עֲצֵי אֲרָזִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,11)\">2Sam 5:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,1)\">1Chr 14:1</ref> + 7 t.; <bdbheb>עֲצֵי בְרוֺשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 52:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,22)\">Jer 52:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 52:24\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,24)\">Jer 52:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 9:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,11)\">Jer 9:11</ref> <bdbheb>ׅ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֲצֵי לְמֻגִּים (אַלְגּ</bdbheb>, see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַלְגּ</bdbheb> above </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> (approximately 175 times; approximately 120 times plural, to denote <highlight>pieces</highlight> [or articles] <highlight>of wood</highlight>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>wood</highlight>, as material; for building, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,13)\">2Kgs 12:13</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אַבְנֵי מַתְצֵב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,6)\">2Kgs 22:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,11)\">2Chr 34:11</ref> (both + <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Neh 2:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,8)\">Neh 2:8</ref> +; <bdbheb>עֲצֵי שָׁ֑מֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,23)\">1Kgs 6:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,31)\">1Kgs 6:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:33\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,33)\">1Kgs 6:33</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,32)\">1Kgs 6:32</ref> <bdbheb>עֲצֵיגֹּֿפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 6:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,14)\">Gen 6:14</ref> (Noah's ark), <bdbheb>עֲצֵי שִׁטִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,5)\">Exod 25:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,10)\">Exod 25:10</ref> + 20 t. Exodus (of tabernacle and its furniture; all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Deut 10:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,3)\">Deut 10:3</ref> <bdbheb>מִגְדַּלעֵֿץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 8:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,4)\">Neh 8:4</ref> <bdbheb>מוֺטִת עֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 28:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,13)\">Jer 28:13</ref> (in figurative; opposed to <bdbheb>בַּרְזֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>כְּלִיעֵֿץ</bdbheb> <highlight>article of wood</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 11:32\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,32)\">Lev 11:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 15:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,12)\">Lev 15:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,20)\">Num 31:20</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Num 35:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,18)\">Num 35:18</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). Hence <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>עֵצִים</bdbheb> = <highlight>articles of wood</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,19)\">Exod 7:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>אֲבָנִים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,2)\">1Chr 29:2</ref> so <bdbheb>עֲצֵי בְרוֺשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,5)\">2Sam 6:5</ref> (but see  <bdbheb><reflink>בְּרוֺשׁ</reflink></bdbheb> <highlight>near the end</highlight>); specifically <bdbheb>הָעֵץ</bdbheb> = helve of axe <ref ref=\"Deut 19:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,5)\">Deut 19:5</ref> <bdbheb>עֵץ חֲנִית(וֺׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,7)\">1Sam 17:7</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>חֵץ</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,20,5)\">1Chr 20:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,19)\">2Sam 21:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,7)\">2Sam 23:7</ref> <bdbheb>עֲצֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הָעֲגָלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 6:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,6,14)\">1Sam 6:14</ref> (i.e. wood of which cart was made), <bdbheb>עֲצֵי הָאֲשֵׁרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,26)\">Judg 6:26</ref> especially <highlight>timbers</highlight> of a house <ref ref=\"Zech 5:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,5,4)\">Zech 5:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 2:11\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,11)\">Hab 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:45\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,45)\">Lev 14:45</ref>, of a city <ref ref=\"1K